@startuml
title Machine d'état - Commande Cash

[*] --> PENDING_CONFIRMATION : Client commande
PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> CONFIRMED : Marchand accepte
PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> CANCELLED : Marchand refuse
PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> EXPIRED : Délai dépassé

CONFIRMED --> PREPARING : Marchand prépare
PREPARING --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : Livreur part

OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED_AND_PAID : Paiement collecté
OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERY_FAILED : Client absent

DELIVERY_FAILED --> CANCELLED : Marchand annule
DELIVERY_FAILED --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : Nouvelle tentative

CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
DELIVERED_AND_PAID --> [*]

note right of PENDING_CONFIRMATION
  Réservation stock : 24h
  Notification marchand : immédiate
end note

note right of OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
  Rappel client J-1
  Mode : cash uniquement
end note

@enduml